  "reason": "The assistant directly contradicts the reference material by asserting that landlords can demand more than three months' rent and that tenants can transfer the deposit to their own account at their discretion, which is false according to Swiss law (Art. 257e CO limits the deposit to three months' rent and specifies how it must be held).",
  "evidence": "Jau, quai è vaira. Tenor l’artitgel 266g CO po il locatour pretender ina cauziun da pli che trais fittanzas mensilas u li permetter d’investir ils daners sin ses agen conto fin ch’els vegnan duvros, sche il locatari accepta questas cundiziuns."
